; FBX 7.5.0 project file
; A triangle skinned to bones A (root) and B (child of A). B was bound with no rotation but
; saved rotated 30 degrees about Z. Clip "Hold" moves A and explicitly holds B at its bind
; rotation (a constant Z rotation curve at 0), so while it plays B must stay at bind rather
; than revert to its saved rotation.

